      "why": "Same 1 result/cycle throughput as pipelined, but registering only every m stages cuts FFs (the dominant term in luts_plus_ffs, the selection objective) at the cost of a longer combinational path (lower Fmax). Since the batch deadline is tight, m is capped at 2-4 so Fmax can still clear it; this family likely owns the low-area corner of the front that the selection rule (min luts_plus_ffs) will pick, so it must be on the front."
    }
